  "details": "GNU Aspell is a spell checker designed to eventually replace Ispell. It can either be used as a library or as an independent spell checker.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * aspell: aspell: Arbitrary code execution via crafted dictionary file (CVE-2026-103658)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
